  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 103.02 Inspection and Copies of Records. Requests for access to records pursuant to RSA 91-A:4 shall be made directly to the executive director by sending a request as required by Plc 104.01 with the information specified in Plc 104.02.\n\nSource. #4420, eff 5-24-88; EXPIRED 5-24-94\n\nNew. #6256, eff 5-25-96; ss by #10482, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14498, eff 3-1-26",
